            <title>Afroverse - An AI-powered music investment platform for the Afrobeat industry</title><link rel="icon" href=""/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/><meta name="title" content="Afroverse - An AI-powered music investment platform for the Afrobeat industry"/><meta name="description" content="Afroverse is a dynamic client portal and membership platform allowing users to submit music demos for investors, participate in challenges, and collaborate."/><meta property="og:title" content="Afroverse - An AI-powered music investment platform for the Afrobeat industry"/><meta property="og:description" content="Afroverse is a dynamic client portal and membership platform allowing users to submit music demos for investors, participate in challenges, and collaborate."/><meta name="twitter:title" content="Afroverse - An AI-powered music investment platform for the Afrobeat industry"/><meta name="twitter:description" content="Afroverse is a dynamic client portal and membership platform allowing users to submit music demos for investors, participate in challenges, and collaborate."/><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"/><meta property="og:url" content="https://afroversemusicgroup.dorik.io/"/><meta property="og:type" content="website"/><link rel="canonical" href="https://afroversemusicgroup.dorik.io/"/><script type="text/javascript"></script><link as="font" rel="preload" href="https://fonts.cmsfly.com/css?family=DM+Sans:400,500,600|Oswald:400,500&display=swap"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.cmsfly.com/css?family=DM+Sans:400,500,600|Oswald:400,500&display=swap"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.dorik.com/6608a1a81d6c290011fd1e5c/css/index.css?v=1713049778584"/>
            
            
