            <section class="dorik-section symbol--header dorik-section-7l3m39mc "><div class=""><div class="container dorik-row-26kjxs2q-wrapper    "><div class="dorik-row-26kjxs2q  flex  "><div class="col-lg-1/1 "><div class="column-inner dorik-column-7czfqv3j  1/1"><div class="dorik-navbar--wrapper dorik-nav-icobvfxe-wrapper  sticky-nav"><div class="dorik-navbar dorik-nav-icobvfxe "><div class="dorik-navbar--brand"><a><img src="https://cdn.dorik.com/6608a1a81d6c290011fd1e5c/images/IMG_20240406_113531_183--s2fr.webp" alt="Logo" width="100px"/></a></div><button aria-label="Navbar Toggle" class="dorik-navbar--toggle" data-target="#dorikNavbarCollapse"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fas" data-icon="bars" class="svg-inline--fa fa-bars fa-fw " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M0 96C0 78.3 14.3 64 32 64H416c17.7 0 32 14.3 32 32s-14.3 32-32 32H32C14.3 128 0 113.7 0 96zM0 256c0-17.7 14.3-32 32-32H416c17.7 0 32 14.3 32 32s-14.3 32-32 32H32c-17.7 0-32-14.3-32-32zM448 416c0 17.7-14.3 32-32 32H32c-17.7 0-32-14.3-32-32s14.3-32 32-32H416c17.7 0 32 14.3 32 32z"></path></svg> </button><div class="dorik-navbar--collapse collapse" id="dorikNavbarCollapse"><div class="dorik-navbar--navs"><ul class="dorik-nav--links normalize"><li class=""><a href="#pricing" class="dorik-nav--link artists dorik-nav--link-jrjtnw95  "><span class="dorik-nav--link-icon"></span><span class="dorik-nav--link-text">artists</span></a></li><li class=""><a href="#testimonials" class="dorik-nav--link events dorik-nav--link-bzdz1ay2  "><span class="dorik-nav--link-icon"></span><span class="dorik-nav--link-text">events</span></a></li><li class=""><a href="#" class="dorik-nav--link home dorik-nav--link-520kovy2  "><span class="dorik-nav--link-text">Home</span></a></li><li class=""><a href="#" class="dorik-nav--link features dorik-nav--link-rv0k6ye2  "><span class="dorik-nav--link-text">Features</span></a></li><li class=""><a href="#" class="dorik-nav--link blog dorik-nav--link-1kdkxlpr  "><span class="dorik-nav--link-text">Blog</span></a></li><li class=""><a href="#" class="dorik-nav--link investment dorik-nav--link-7204yd7r  "><span class="dorik-nav--link-text">Investment</span></a></li><li class=""><a href="#" class="dorik-nav--link about-us dorik-nav--link-u3pr0hxf  "><span class="dorik-nav--link-text">About us</span></a></li><li class=""><a href="#" class="dorik-nav--link contact-us dorik-nav--link-1p2igzgy  "><span class="dorik-nav--link-text">Contact us</span></a></li></ul><ul class="dorik-nav--btns normalize"><li><a href="#" class="dorik-nav--btn dorik-nav--btn-5xmbnhej vibes "><span class="dorik-nav--btn-icon"></span><span class="dorik-nav--btn-text">vibes</span></a></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="dorik-section dorik-section-c3e39yva  color-overlay"><div class=""><div class="container dorik-row-1qm4lq6w-wrapper    "><div class="dorik-row-1qm4lq6w  flex  "><div class="col-lg-1/1 "><div class="column-inner dorik-column-m49c2j82  1/1"><div class="dorik-wrapper dorik-heading-ixg3pj7x-wrapper "><h4 class="dorik-heading dorik-heading-ixg3pj7x "><span>Revolutionizing Afrobeat Music with Technology and Innovation
</span></h4></div><div class="dorik-text dorik-text-apfhgnw9 "><p>Afroverse allows artists to raise funding for projects while investors can support talent and earn returns. Get your music on all platforms while meeting other creatives.</p>
</div><div class="dorik-button-1ge8qlko-wrapper  el-ib"><button class="dorik-btn dorik-button-1ge8qlko  "><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fas" data-icon="arrow-right" class="svg-inline--fa fa-arrow-right fa-fw icon " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512" data-testid="icon-test"><path fill="currentColor" d="M438.6 278.6c12.5-12.5 12.5-32.8 0-45.3l-160-160c-12.5-12.5-32.8-12.5-45.3 0s-12.5 32.8 0 45.3L338.8 224 32 224c-17.7 0-32 14.3-32 32s14.3 32 32 32l306.7 0L233.4 393.4c-12.5 12.5-12.5 32.8 0 45.3s32.8 12.5 45.3 0l160-160z"></path></svg>Submit Demo</button></div><div class="dorik-button-pz6drves-wrapper  el-ib"><button class="dorik-btn dorik-button-pz6drves  "><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fas" data-icon="arrow-right" class="svg-inline--fa fa-arrow-right fa-fw icon " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512" data-testid="icon-test"><path fill="currentColor" d="M438.6 278.6c12.5-12.5 12.5-32.8 0-45.3l-160-160c-12.5-12.5-32.8-12.5-45.3 0s-12.5 32.8 0 45.3L338.8 224 32 224c-17.7 0-32 14.3-32 32s14.3 32 32 32l306.7 0L233.4 393.4c-12.5 12.5-12.5 32.8 0 45.3s32.8 12.5 45.3 0l160-160z"></path></svg>Start Investing</button></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="dorik-section dorik-section-97j8ki4q "><div class="dorik-container-0bn6knne  "><div class="dorik-container-8njlaigg  "><div class="dorik-text dorik-text-ya2qn5y6 ">Welcome to</div><div class="dorik-wrapper dorik-heading-5q6zs3h4-wrapper "><h2 class="dorik-heading dorik-heading-5q6zs3h4 "><span>A Revolutionary Platform for Afrobeat Creators and Investors</span></h2></div><div class="dorik-text dorik-text-l7lx1s04 ">Afroverse allows artists to upload demos for feedback and investment, participate in creative challenges, form project collaborations, and gain access to exclusive industry events.</div><div class="dorik-button-udjd4vj3-wrapper  "><button class="dorik-btn dorik-button-udjd4vj3  "><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fas" data-icon="arrow-right" class="svg-inline--fa fa-arrow-right fa-fw icon " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512" data-testid="icon-test"><path fill="currentColor" d="M438.6 278.6c12.5-12.5 12.5-32.8 0-45.3l-160-160c-12.5-12.5-32.8-12.5-45.3 0s-12.5 32.8 0 45.3L338.8 224 32 224c-17.7 0-32 14.3-32 32s14.3 32 32 32l306.7 0L233.4 393.4c-12.5 12.5-12.5 32.8 0 45.3s32.8 12.5 45.3 0l160-160z"></path></svg>Learn More</button></div></div><div class="dorik-container-tjzikyac  "><div class="dorik-container-qftkuhra  "><div class="dorik-container-8kq6xuzg  "><div class="dorik-wrapper dorik-heading-g02ogast-wrapper "><h2 class="dorik-heading dorik-heading-g02ogast "><span>1</span></h2></div><div class="dorik-wrapper dorik-heading-z3on3rmz-wrapper "><h4 class="dorik-heading dorik-heading-z3on3rmz "><span>Upload</span></h4></div><div class="dorik-text dorik-text-lddwgi0a ">Artists can upload demo tracks and get detailed feedback and investment offers from our network of top music industry professionals.</div></div><div class="dorik-container-nzt206m2  "><div class="dorik-wrapper dorik-heading-nycc88od-wrapper "><h2 class="dorik-heading dorik-heading-nycc88od "><span>2</span></h2></div><div class="dorik-wrapper dorik-heading-i71lljds-wrapper "><h4 class="dorik-heading dorik-heading-i71lljds "><span>Collaborate</span></h4></div><div class="dorik-text dorik-text-12vtvfbp ">Our platform connects artists for creative collaborations and provides the tools and support to bring projects to life.</div></div><div class="dorik-container-zpu98uiy  "><div class="dorik-wrapper dorik-heading-nt9jr4xr-wrapper "><h2 class="dorik-heading dorik-heading-nt9jr4xr "><span>3</span></h2></div><div class="dorik-wrapper dorik-heading-risrzwyf-wrapper "><h4 class="dorik-heading dorik-heading-risrzwyf "><span>Compete</span></h4></div><div class="dorik-text dorik-text-926q12gv "><p>Take part in creative challenges with big prizes at stake to showcase talent and get discovered by industry leaders.</p>
</div></div><div class="dorik-container-o4tflufn  "><div class="dorik-wrapper dorik-heading-9kgm8vum-wrapper "><h2 class="dorik-heading dorik-heading-9kgm8vum "><span>4</span></h2></div><div class="dorik-wrapper dorik-heading-3ey6pnj5-wrapper "><h4 class="dorik-heading dorik-heading-3ey6pnj5 "><span>Network</span></h4></div><div class="dorik-text dorik-text-wew40vyi ">Gain access to members-only industry events, concerts, conferences and award shows to expand your professional network.</div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="dorik-section dorik-section-0bkulqpo "><div class=""><div class="container dorik-row-gtjpvm2f-wrapper    "><div class="dorik-row-gtjpvm2f  flex  "><div class="col-lg-1/1 "><div class="column-inner dorik-column-qfzzbls0  1/1"><div class="dorik-wrapper dorik-heading-m7wqbem0-wrapper "><h2 class="dorik-heading dorik-heading-m7wqbem0 "><span>Key Features</span></h2></div><div class="dorik-text dorik-text-1tpga63z "><p>Afroverse is an innovative AI-powered music platform designed specifically for the Afrobeat industry. It provides tools for demo submissions, cross-border collaborations, music distribution, investment opportunities, community engagement, and more.</p>
</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="container dorik-row-45df1ykc-wrapper    "><div class="dorik-row-45df1ykc  flex  "><div class="col-lg-1/3 col-md-1/2 "><div class="column-inner dorik-column-rzhbtxtv  1/3"><div class="dorik-icon-f0f2olao-wrapper  "><span class="dorik-icon dorik-icon-f0f2olao  "><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fas" data-icon="music" class="svg-inline--fa fa-music fa-fw icon " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512" data-testid="icon-test"><path fill="currentColor" d="M499.1 6.3c8.1 6 12.9 15.6 12.9 25.7v72V368c0 44.2-43 80-96 80s-96-35.8-96-80s43-80 96-80c11.2 0 22 1.6 32 4.6V147L192 223.8V432c0 44.2-43 80-96 80s-96-35.8-96-80s43-80 96-80c11.2 0 22 1.6 32 4.6V200 128c0-14.1 9.3-26.6 22.8-30.7l320-96c9.7-2.9 20.2-1.1 28.3 5z"></path></svg></span></div><div class="dorik-wrapper dorik-heading-qebzcg0a-wrapper "><h4 class="dorik-heading dorik-heading-qebzcg0a "><span>Key Tools</span></h4></div><div class="dorik-text dorik-text-6bylewep ">Afroverse offers a robust set of tools for music creation and collaboration.</div></div></div><div class="col-lg-1/3 col-md-1/2 col-xs-7/8 "><div class="column-inner dorik-column-s06a52s5  1/3"><div class="dorik-icon-yc6fkwxj-wrapper  "><span class="dorik-icon dorik-icon-yc6fkwxj  "><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fas" data-icon="file-audio" class="svg-inline--fa fa-file-audio fa-fw icon " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 384 512" data-testid="icon-test"><path fill="currentColor" d="M64 0C28.7 0 0 28.7 0 64V448c0 35.3 28.7 64 64 64H320c35.3 0 64-28.7 64-64V160H256c-17.7 0-32-14.3-32-32V0H64zM256 0V128H384L256 0zm2 226.3c37.1 22.4 62 63.1 62 109.7s-24.9 87.3-62 109.7c-7.6 4.6-17.4 2.1-22-5.4s-2.1-17.4 5.4-22C269.4 401.5 288 370.9 288 336s-18.6-65.5-46.5-82.3c-7.6-4.6-10-14.4-5.4-22s14.4-10 22-5.4zm-91.9 30.9c6 2.5 9.9 8.3 9.9 14.8V400c0 6.5-3.9 12.3-9.9 14.8s-12.9 1.1-17.4-3.5L113.4 376H80c-8.8 0-16-7.2-16-16V312c0-8.8 7.2-16 16-16h33.4l35.3-35.3c4.6-4.6 11.5-5.9 17.4-3.5zm51 34.9c6.6-5.9 16.7-5.3 22.6 1.3C249.8 304.6 256 319.6 256 336s-6.2 31.4-16.3 42.7c-5.9 6.6-16 7.1-22.6 1.3s-7.1-16-1.3-22.6c5.1-5.7 8.1-13.1 8.1-21.3s-3.1-15.7-8.1-21.3c-5.9-6.6-5.3-16.7 1.3-22.6z"></path></svg></span></div><div class="dorik-wrapper dorik-heading-25ns5yzx-wrapper "><h4 class="dorik-heading dorik-heading-25ns5yzx "><span>Demos</span></h4></div><div class="dorik-text dorik-text-uk2p8jz0 ">Artists can easily submit demos for feedback and opportunities.</div></div></div><div class="col-lg-1/3 col-md-1/2 col-xs-7/8 "><div class="column-inner dorik-column-0eybf9g6  1/3"><div class="dorik-icon-2py3bu7k-wrapper  "><span class="dorik-icon dorik-icon-2py3bu7k  "><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fas" data-icon="people-arrows" class="svg-inline--fa fa-people-arrows fa-fw icon " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 640 512" data-testid="icon-test"><path fill="currentColor" d="M64 64a64 64 0 1 1 128 0A64 64 0 1 1 64 64zM25.9 233.4C29.3 191.9 64 160 105.6 160h44.8c27 0 51 13.4 65.5 34.1c-2.7 1.9-5.2 4-7.5 6.3l-64 64c-21.9 21.9-21.9 57.3 0 79.2L192 391.2V464c0 26.5-21.5 48-48 48H112c-26.5 0-48-21.5-48-48V348.3c-26.5-9.5-44.7-35.8-42.2-65.6l4.1-49.3zM448 64a64 64 0 1 1 128 0A64 64 0 1 1 448 64zM431.6 200.4c-2.3-2.3-4.9-4.4-7.5-6.3c14.5-20.7 38.6-34.1 65.5-34.1h44.8c41.6 0 76.3 31.9 79.7 73.4l4.1 49.3c2.5 29.8-15.7 56.1-42.2 65.6V464c0 26.5-21.5 48-48 48H496c-26.5 0-48-21.5-48-48V391.2l47.6-47.6c21.9-21.9 21.9-57.3 0-79.2l-64-64zM272 240v32h96V240c0-9.7 5.8-18.5 14.8-22.2s19.3-1.7 26.2 5.2l64 64c9.4 9.4 9.4 24.6 0 33.9l-64 64c-6.9 6.9-17.2 8.9-26.2 5.2s-14.8-12.5-14.8-22.2V336H272v32c0 9.7-5.8 18.5-14.8 22.2s-19.3 1.7-26.2-5.2l-64-64c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9l64-64c6.9-6.9 17.2-8.9 26.2-5.2s14.8 12.5 14.8 22.2z"></path></svg></span></div><div class="dorik-wrapper dorik-heading-6kfruvjf-wrapper "><h4 class="dorik-heading dorik-heading-6kfruvjf "><span>Collab</span></h4></div><div class="dorik-text dorik-text-jz5n5hhl ">Find collaborators, manage permissions, share projects in one secure platform.</div></div></div><div class="col-lg-1/3 col-md-1/2 col-xs-7/8 "><div class="column-inner dorik-column-hw5xrods  1/3"><div class="dorik-icon-gp1b22te-wrapper  "><span class="dorik-icon dorik-icon-gp1b22te  "><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fas" data-icon="compact-disc" class="svg-inline--fa fa-compact-disc fa-fw icon " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512" data-testid="icon-test"><path fill="currentColor" d="M0 256a256 256 0 1 1 512 0A256 256 0 1 1 0 256zm256 32a32 32 0 1 1 0-64 32 32 0 1 1 0 64zm-96-32a96 96 0 1 0 192 0 96 96 0 1 0 -192 0zM96 240c0-35 17.5-71.1 45.2-98.8S205 96 240 96c8.8 0 16-7.2 16-16s-7.2-16-16-16c-45.4 0-89.2 22.3-121.5 54.5S64 194.6 64 240c0 8.8 7.2 16 16 16s16-7.2 16-16z"></path></svg></span></div><div class="dorik-wrapper dorik-heading-fq5oukmu-wrapper "><h4 class="dorik-heading dorik-heading-fq5oukmu "><span>Distribution</span></h4></div><div class="dorik-text dorik-text-cdd9vavo ">Get music distributed to major platforms and access real-time streaming analytics.</div></div></div><div class="col-lg-1/3 col-md-1/2 col-xs-7/8 "><div class="column-inner dorik-column-8kjvmfs1  1/3"><div class="dorik-icon-mad10yx5-wrapper  "><span class="dorik-icon dorik-icon-mad10yx5  "><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fas" data-icon="money-bill-wave" class="svg-inline--fa fa-money-bill-wave fa-fw icon " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512" data-testid="icon-test"><path fill="currentColor" d="M0 112.5V422.3c0 18 10.1 35 27 41.3c87 32.5 174 10.3 261-11.9c79.8-20.3 159.6-40.7 239.3-18.9c23 6.3 48.7-9.5 48.7-33.4V89.7c0-18-10.1-35-27-41.3C462 15.9 375 38.1 288 60.3C208.2 80.6 128.4 100.9 48.7 79.1C25.6 72.8 0 88.6 0 112.5zM288 352c-44.2 0-80-43-80-96s35.8-96 80-96s80 43 80 96s-35.8 96-80 96zM64 352c35.3 0 64 28.7 64 64H64V352zm64-208c0 35.3-28.7 64-64 64V144h64zM512 304v64H448c0-35.3 28.7-64 64-64zM448 96h64v64c-35.3 0-64-28.7-64-64z"></path></svg></span></div><div class="dorik-wrapper dorik-heading-s2beorhy-wrapper "><h4 class="dorik-heading dorik-heading-s2beorhy "><span>Investments</span></h4></div><div class="dorik-text dorik-text-q5ftpcgi ">Invest in artists and songs or raise funds for your own projects on the built-in exchange.</div></div></div><div class="col-lg-1/3 col-md-1/2 "><div class="column-inner dorik-column-9ixjpz6q  1/3"><div class="dorik-icon-sbzfs32t-wrapper  "><span class="dorik-icon dorik-icon-sbzfs32t  "><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fas" data-icon="comments" class="svg-inline--fa fa-comments fa-fw icon " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 640 512" data-testid="icon-test"><path fill="currentColor" d="M208 352c114.9 0 208-78.8 208-176S322.9 0 208 0S0 78.8 0 176c0 38.6 14.7 74.3 39.6 103.4c-3.5 9.4-8.7 17.7-14.2 24.7c-4.8 6.2-9.7 11-13.3 14.3c-1.8 1.6-3.3 2.9-4.3 3.7c-.5 .4-.9 .7-1.1 .8l-.2 .2 0 0 0 0C1 327.2-1.4 334.4 .8 340.9S9.1 352 16 352c21.8 0 43.8-5.6 62.1-12.5c9.2-3.5 17.8-7.4 25.3-11.4C134.1 343.3 169.8 352 208 352zM448 176c0 112.3-99.1 196.9-216.5 207C255.8 457.4 336.4 512 432 512c38.2 0 73.9-8.7 104.7-23.9c7.5 4 16 7.9 25.2 11.4c18.3 6.9 40.3 12.5 62.1 12.5c6.9 0 13.1-4.5 15.2-11.1c2.1-6.6-.2-13.8-5.8-17.9l0 0 0 0-.2-.2c-.2-.2-.6-.4-1.1-.8c-1-.8-2.5-2-4.3-3.7c-3.6-3.3-8.5-8.1-13.3-14.3c-5.5-7-10.7-15.4-14.2-24.7c24.9-29 39.6-64.7 39.6-103.4c0-92.8-84.9-168.9-192.6-175.5c.4 5.1 .6 10.3 .6 15.5z"></path></svg></span></div><div class="dorik-wrapper dorik-heading-fow93q7i-wrapper "><h4 class="dorik-heading dorik-heading-fow93q7i "><span>Community</span></h4></div><div class="dorik-text dorik-text-g2pup0mn ">Engage with other artists and industry professionals in Afroverse's vibrant online community.</div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="dorik-section dorik-section-gy0plj93 