Emmyhood
</span></h4></div><div class="dorik-text dorik-text-517i1gzn ">Invest in a producer creating a new Afro-house dance album targeting global markets.</div><div class="dorik-button-nlr1yhz5-wrapper  "><a class="dorik-btn dorik-button-nlr1yhz5  " href="/single-course"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fas" data-icon="arrow-right" class="svg-inline--fa fa-arrow-right fa-fw icon " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512" data-testid="icon-test"><path fill="currentColor" d="M438.6 278.6c12.5-12.5 12.5-32.8 0-45.3l-160-160c-12.5-12.5-32.8-12.5-45.3 0s-12.5 32.8 0 45.3L338.8 224 32 224c-17.7 0-32 14.3-32 32s14.3 32 32 32l306.7 0L233.4 393.4c-12.5 12.5-12.5 32.8 0 45.3s32.8 12.5 45.3 0l160-160z"></path></svg>Learn more</a></div></div></div><div class="col-lg-1/3 col-md-1/2 "><div class="column-inner dorik-column-wiiugqiy  1/3"><div class="dorik-wrapper dorik-image-ok9kxy9r-wrapper "><img src="https://cdn.dorik.com/6608a1a81d6c290011fd1e5c/images/_31b7e3ad-c386-4706-8e36-4ffb6732099b-_JGFe.jpeg" alt="" loading="lazy" class="dorik-image-ok9kxy9r "/></div><div class="dorik-wrapper dorik-heading-yj0qi6s0-wrapper "><h4 class="dorik-heading dorik-heading-yj0qi6s0 "><span>Time and life
D'mili
</span></h4></div><div class="dorik-text dorik-text-i8gn51ue "><p>Support d'mili's music, an afro-pop talented artists building his career</p>
</div><div class="dorik-button-7jsc4opz-wrapper  "><a class="dorik-btn dorik-button-7jsc4opz  " href="/single-course"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fas" data-icon="arrow-right" class="svg-inline--fa fa-arrow-right fa-fw icon " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512" data-testid="icon-test"><path fill="currentColor" d="M438.6 278.6c12.5-12.5 12.5-32.8 0-45.3l-160-160c-12.5-12.5-32.8-12.5-45.3 0s-12.5 32.8 0 45.3L338.8 224 32 224c-17.7 0-32 14.3-32 32s14.3 32 32 32l306.7 0L233.4 393.4c-12.5 12.5-12.5 32.8 0 45.3s32.8 12.5 45.3 0l160-160z"></path></svg>Learn more</a></div></div></div><div class="col-lg-1/3 col-md-1/2 "><div class="column-inner dorik-column-6gmiyevz  1/3"><div class="dorik-wrapper dorik-image-1222nkkh-wrapper "><img src="https://cdn.dorik.com/6608a1a81d6c290011fd1e5c/images/_53006051-4406-4217-b0fe-9fe8d6dec747-e8OD7.jpeg" alt="" loading="lazy" class="dorik-image-1222nkkh "/></div><div class="dorik-wrapper dorik-heading-rtdrqik3-wrapper "><h4 class="dorik-heading dorik-heading-rtdrqik3 "><span>Afrohive metaverse
</span></h4></div><div class="dorik-text dorik-text-t5xg4dfv "><p>Invest in afrohive, a music gaming app that leverages artificial intelligence, blockchain and virtual reality to empower users.</p>
</div><div class="dorik-button-xr7837jt-wrapper  "><a class="dorik-btn dorik-button-xr7837jt  " href="/single-course"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fas" data-icon="arrow-right" class="svg-inline--fa fa-arrow-right fa-fw icon " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512" data-testid="icon-test"><path fill="currentColor" d="M438.6 278.6c12.5-12.5 12.5-32.8 0-45.3l-160-160c-12.5-12.5-32.8-12.5-45.3 0s-12.5 32.8 0 45.3L338.8 224 32 224c-17.7 0-32 14.3-32 32s14.3 32 32 32l306.7 0L233.4 393.4c-12.5 12.5-12.5 32.8 0 45.3s32.8 12.5 45.3 0l160-160z"></path></svg>Learn more</a></div></div></div><div class="col-lg-1/3 col-md-1/2 "><div class="column-inner dorik-column-0pjqsgib  1/3"><div class="dorik-wrapper dorik-image-77neoy5d-wrapper "><img src="https://cdn.dorik.com/6608a1a81d6c290011fd1e5c/images/_12aecf89-65b2-4b41-9ba9-06e99ad94e91-YNck_.jpeg" alt="" loading="lazy" class="dorik-image-77neoy5d "/></div><div class="dorik-wrapper dorik-heading-uuv6rq4e-wrapper "><h4 class="dorik-heading dorik-heading-uuv6rq4e "><span>Afro-African rhythms&nbsp;
</span></h4></div><div class="dorik-text dorik-text-phqey7rw " src="https://cdn.dorik.com/6608a1a81d6c290011fd1e5c/images/_12aecf89-65b2-4b41-9ba9-06e99ad94e91-YNck_.jpeg"><p>Invest in the upcoming event "afro-african rhythms" that aims to celebrate Africa culture and heritage&nbsp;</p>
</div><div class="dorik-button-fmdk8qxz-wrapper  "><a class="dorik-btn dorik-button-fmdk8qxz  " href="/single-course"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fas" data-icon="arrow-right" class="svg-inline--fa fa-arrow-right fa-fw icon " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512" data-testid="icon-test"><path fill="currentColor" d="M438.6 278.6c12.5-12.5 12.5-32.8 0-45.3l-160-160c-12.5-12.5-32.8-12.5-45.3 0s-12.5 32.8 0 45.3L338.8 224 32 224c-17.7 0-32 14.3-32 32s14.3 32 32 32l306.7 0L233.4 393.4c-12.5 12.5-12.5 32.8 0 45.3s32.8 12.5 45.3 0l160-160z"></path></svg>Learn more</a></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="dorik-section dorik-section-j3m40xg1 "><div class=""><div class="container dorik-row-3nmdi5cz-wrapper    "><div class="dorik-row-3nmdi5cz  flex  "><div class="col-lg-5/7 col-md-7/8 "><div class="column-inner dorik-column-4as8cpl9  5/7"><div class="dorik-wrapper dorik-heading-befy8251-wrapper "><h2 class="dorik-heading dorik-heading-befy8251 "><span>Common Afroverse Queries</span></h2></div><div class="dorik-text dorik-text-8olx8lbw ">Find answers to frequently asked questions about setting up your Afroverse account, making investments, submitting artist profiles, profit sharing, access to exclusive events, and more.</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="container dorik-row-7a61aj0f-wrapper    "><div class="dorik-row-7a61aj0f  flex  "><div class="col-lg-2/5 col-md-1/2 "><div class="column-inner dorik-column-aafeiqtd  2/5"><div class="dorik-wrapper dorik-heading-6wmm33pr-wrapper "><h5 class="dorik-heading dorik-heading-6wmm33pr "><span>Accounts</span></h5></div><div class="dorik-text dorik-text-2t88nire ">Learn how to create and manage your Afroverse account, connect bank accounts and payment methods, refer friends, and maximize account security.</div></div></div><div class="col-lg-2/5 col-md-1/2 "><div class="column-inner dorik-column-fq8ocmrs  2/5"><div class="dorik-wrapper dorik-heading-q8kaun3b-wrapper "><h5 class="dorik-heading dorik-heading-q8kaun3b "><span>Investing</span></h5></div><div class="dorik-text dorik-text-2hizf2bf ">Understand how investing on Afroverse works, discover upcoming investment opportunities, and learn strategies for responsible investments in high-potential Afrobeat artists and startups.</div></div></div><div class="col-lg-2/5 col-md-1/2 "><div class="column-inner dorik-column-gg37g4ym  2/5"><div class="dorik-wrapper dorik-heading-taypeul7-wrapper "><h5 class="dorik-heading dorik-heading-taypeul7 "><span>Artists</span></h5></div><div class="dorik-text dorik-text-9u1twhf3 ">Find out how to submit your artist profile for consideration by our analysts and discover what criteria we use to identify promising, investment-worthy talents with strong commercial viability.</div></div></div><div class="col-lg-2/5 col-md-1/2 "><div class="column-inner dorik-column-myg1vrag  2/5"><div class="dorik-wrapper dorik-heading-w83rczha-wrapper "><h5 class="dorik-heading dorik-heading-w83rczha "><span>Profit Share</span></h5></div><div class="dorik-text dorik-text-bta299fr ">Learn about Afroverse's fair and innovative profit sharing model that lets investors share in the success of their investments as partnered artists and startups achieve revenue milestones.</div></div></div><div class="col-lg-2/5 col-md-1/2 "><div class="column-inner dorik-column-i5o14e6z  2/5"><div class="dorik-wrapper dorik-heading-i84cc3p4-wrapper "><h5 class="dorik-heading dorik-heading-i84cc3p4 "><span>Events </span></h5></div><div class="dorik-text dorik-text-8hf1ookk ">As an Afroverse member, get exclusive access to members-only events like album previews, influencer mixers, startup pitch events and more.</div></div></div><div class="col-lg-2/5 col-md-1/2 "><div class="column-inner dorik-column-ga7quje8  2/5"><div class="dorik-wrapper dorik-heading-i27k6y0b-wrapper "><h5 class="dorik-heading dorik-heading-i27k6y0b "><span>Support</span></h5></div><div class="dorik-text dorik-text-644ixlqx ">Have additional questions? Reach out to our world-class customer support team for assistance via live chat, email or phone support.</div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="dorik-section dorik-section-cuq58fnm "><div class=""><div class="container dorik-row-xedv6bco-wrapper    "><div class="dorik-row-xedv6bco  flex  "><div class="col-lg-5/7 col-md-1/1 "><div class="column-inner dorik-column-za2mczpa  5/7"><div class="dorik-wrapper dorik-heading-ng4umujy-wrapper "><h2 class="dorik-heading dorik-heading-ng4umujy "><span>Hottest hits from Nigeria's finest music stars</span></h2></div><div class="dorik-text dorik-text-1xr63p9g ">Check out the latest releases making waves across Africa right now from Wizkid, Burna Boy, Davido, Tems, Asake and more top artists leading the Afrobeat revolution.</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="container dorik-row-7jf32ahk-wrapper    "><div class="dorik-row-7jf32ahk  flex  "><div class="col-lg-1/3 col-md-1/2 col-xs-1/1 "><div class="column-inner dorik-column-3vgtow1j  1/3"><div class=""><div class=" dorik-row-cxb8g9ud-wrapper    "><div class="dorik-row-cxb8g9ud  flex  "><div class="col-lg-1/2 col-md-1/2 col-xs-2/5 "><div class="column-inner dorik-column-z4ob5n88  1/2"><div class="dorik-wrapper dorik-image-dzrgik7b-wrapper "><img src="https://cdn.dorik.com/624c0f1f9f34ad00115b5b4c/628733257278ca0011365366/images/unsplash_IF9TK5Uy-KI_exow53ok.png" alt="" loading="lazy" class="dorik-image-dzrgik7b "/></div></div></div><div class="col-lg-1/2 col-md-1/2 col-xs-3/5 "><div class="column-inner dorik-column-9ozlp8ij  1/2"><div class="dorik-text dorik-text-aswhycu6 "><p>Digital marketer</p>
